{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swing, grapple and navigate unique environments.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tentaphages are agile creatures. They can stick to various surfaces and use their tentacles to launch themselves great distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.poster.avif?t=1756489660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.webm?t=1756489660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.mp4?t=1756489660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control human minds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tentaphages can seize control of others, forcing them to carry out their will. But crewmates don\u2019t take kindly to seeing a parasite latched onto a friend\u2019s back\u2014expect them to open fire the moment they spot you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.poster.avif?t=1756489660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.webm?t=1756489660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.mp4?t=1756489660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock customizations for your Tentaphage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change to your favorite color any time. Want more variety? Unlock 13 different custom themed Tentaphages through the Steam Achievement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.poster.avif?t=1756489660\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.webm?t=1756489660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.mp4?t=1756489660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock the secrets of the lore behind an evolving universe.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the known universe, a mysterious species of Tentaphages have begun to appear\u2014and their colossal Mother is slowly falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew discovers a strange shard of an interdimensional goddess over halfway through their 60 year wavering voyage to recover Epsilon Material (EpsMat), a volatile substance rumored to warp space-time itself. The crew finds their ship is being invaded by these unknown creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth through scattered notes, cryptic dialogue, and the dangerous encounters that await you in the void.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Made in America - Freedom ain't free, but this is.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/43a23fa7db0dcf7813ae4d399b392cc84904d733.jpg"},{"name":"Conjurer of cheap Tricks or Treats?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/fa1c5d58ef07bf3969d924f3253487e6fb18e1f3.jpg"},{"name":"This thing better not come down my chimney...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/aa7a89db53e21a3efa041e6c65a669465ec2440f.jpg"},{"name":"Wear it with pride!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/9c041a85f2e1283827c862f8f39669fdca16682c.jpg"},{"name":"Do you like swimming?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/545e73022f108243a54b4360b99a495d8aca981b.jpg"},{"name":"Float like a bubble, and sting like a jellyfish.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/d3771fbb1927088fe24be9ef3dce7eee5e58bda5.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Medal.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/69c954bffdca471ebf26192ea18f9940c8bdab5d.jpg"},{"name":"All that glitters is gold for those who go for the stars.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/55ad54749260a65c5542d7c1732d8e75944d9c10.jpg"},{"name":"Soaring through the cosmos.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/a3438472e2eedfd742ca5b84c46b6a8b9aece2db.jpg"},{"name":"Life of the party.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854760/605614df8fa04956a6c8f040810006ef974eeb2c.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854760?t=1756489660","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/e777b03486135486de57e5b5d20eb8b4f2d345a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756489660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/eaee1b58141fb72071383fc681d61797398eaa11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756489660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/eaee1b58141fb72071383fc681d61797398eaa11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756489660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{